  "notes": "Card-heavy personal travel dashboard. Hero is a giant featured-trip card with a silver gradient, ~110px white title and a frosted pill-shaped stat bar with dotted dividers and ticket-notch cut-outs at its sides. Trip cards use vivid gradient covers (cyan, peach, violet) instead of photos, with overlaid white titles and a row of round translucent dark action buttons. Sidebar widgets are big 28px-radius white panels with letter-spaced uppercase headers; collections are colorful gradient pills with count chips. The one dark KPI tile (countries visited) anchors the stat strip. Primary nav is itself a segmented pill group in the centered top bar. A dashed-border 'New Trip' placeholder card ends the grid, plus a floating dark pill 'New Trip' FAB."
